### Global CSS

To customize the ColorSwatch component classes, you can use the `@layer components` directive.
[Learn more](https://tailwindcss.com/docs/adding-custom-styles#adding-component-classes).

```css
@layer components {
  .color-swatch {
    @apply border-2 border-white;
  }
}
```

